  - kind: 1
    emotion: panting
    text: Lord save us, I nearly lost my shawl in the crush! Down at Flour Store
      No. 3 the crowd broke the shutters, and the mounted police came down the lane
      with flats of their sabers!
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: 
    optionB: 
    next: -1
    nextA: -1
    nextB: -1
    rule:
      parameter: 
      greaterThan: 0
    remember: 
    value: 0
  - kind: 2
    emotion: whisper
    text: The dockers say army barges are hauling the grain out after midnight while
      we stand in line for chaff. Are you going to print what happened at the store?
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: I'll run the story.
    optionB: Go home and lock your door.
    next: -1
    nextA: 3
    nextB: 4
    rule:
      parameter: 
      greaterThan: 0
    remember: 
    value: 0
  - kind: 1
    emotion: default
    text: Thank you, son. Let the whole town read what they did to hungry women.
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: 
    optionB: 
    next: 5
    nextA: -1
    nextB: -1
